      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Define and iterate on diagnostic checklists for appliances and power tools.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, following up on our discussion about inconsistent diagnosis. I've created first drafts of the diagnostic checklists for appliances (A2) and power tools (A3). These are based on the initial info for T2 and T3. Appreciate your expert review to make sure they're practical for the field.",
            "mentions": [
              47068,
              61983,
              63344
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A3",
              "T2",
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 47068,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Looking at A2 for appliances. It seems to cover the main things. Should we add a section for the customer to sign off on the diagnosis before we start the repair?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 63344,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "A3 looks ok. Maybe a bit long.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "That's an interesting idea. It could help with quote approvals. Let's think about the workflow impact. Does it require a second visit if they aren't home?",
            "mentions": [
              47068
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 61983,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "I've reviewed A3. It's a good start, but it's missing critical steps that will help us avoid rework. For battery tools, we need a mandatory load test on the battery and a check on the charger output. For corded tools, we need to check for continuity from the plug all the way to the switch. I can write up the exact steps.",
            "mentions": [
              63344
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "memo",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 47068,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "Oh, good point. Maybe not a signature then. Maybe just a checkbox that we 'verbally confirmed quote with customer'.",
            "mentions": [
              547643
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "That would be fantastic, thank you. Your expertise here is key. Please add those steps directly as comments in the doc for A3.",
            "mentions": [
              61983
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": "M24",
            "text": "I like that. It's a simple confirmation without adding process overhead. Let's add that. So for A2, the minimum required steps will be: Intake, Safety Check, Diagnostic Steps, Parts Needed, and 'Verbal Quote Confirmation'. Everyone ok with that?",
            "mentions": [
              47068
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D3"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 47068,
            "reply_to": "M26",
            "text": "Yes, that works.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 61983,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "OK, I've added my comments to A3 with the specific tests for battery and corded tools. Those should be considered mandatory steps.",
            "mentions": [
              547643
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "Just reviewed them. They are clear and directly address the rework issue. So, for A3, we'll approve the checklist with the mandatory steps for: Visual Inspection, Electrical Tests (including continuity/load testing), and Functional Tests. Agreed?",
            "mentions": [
              61983,
              63344
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M30",
            "speaker_id": 61983,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "Agreed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 63344,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "ok",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": "M29",
            "text": "Excellent. We have sign-off on the core requirements for both checklists (D3, D4). I'll update the documents. We will refine these further based on pilot feedback as part of T11.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
