            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 319539,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "On a related note, for T6, I've put together some notes for the handling and transport procedure, A6. It's mostly about safe lifting and how to coordinate hand-offs with technicians on-site for heavy items like servers or large displays.",
            "mentions": [
              547643
