            "speaker_id": 547643,
            "reply_to": "M33",
            "text": "This is great, proactive work from both of you. I'm reviewing A4 now. Did you ensure it aligns with the latest regulatory requirements for signal strength?",
            "mentions": [
              125309
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 125309,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "Yes, I've included the acceptable dBm range and the requirement to log the final reading in the job notes, which covers our compliance needs.",
            "mentions": [
